| **`alert()`** | Shows a blocking popup dialog on-screen; pauses execution until dismissed |
| **`<script src="...">`** | Loads an external `.js` file into an HTML page |
| **Camel case** | `backgroundColor` — JS's naming style for multi-word properties |
| **Kebab case** | `background-color` — CSS's naming style for multi-word properties |
| **Synchronous** | Code executes strictly top-to-bottom, in order |
| **Asynchronous** | Code can execute out of normal top-to-bottom order (deferred to future sessions) |

